{{!--
Body of a reference document (« Mentions légales », confidentialité, conditions…): page-mentions-legales.hbs
for the slug "mentions-legales", custom-document.hbs (menu « Template » > Document) for any other page.
Inside the page's template context. See docs/guide-auteur.md (« Mentions légales et pages de référence »).
  - Title and excerpt (« Excerpt »): the page's, unless « Show title and feature image » is off (the title
    then stays for screen readers). No feature image: a document opens on its text.
  - « Dernière mise à jour »: Ghost's updated_at, the date of the page's last save.
  - « Imprimer »: shown by page.js (it calls the browser's print); css/print.css lays the page out on paper.
  - « Sommaire »: built by page.js (src/js/document.js) from the h2 and h3 of the content when there are
    at least two; a disclosure above the text, sticky beside it on wide screens. Without JavaScript there
    is no table of contents (the headings keep their anchors).
  - The content: the generic page's reading column (pages/content.css); a <dl> sets out who / where / how
    to reach (publisher, host) as a compact identity block; headings get the copy-link button of articles.
data-copy-link / data-link-copied: the strings of the copy-link buttons (src/js/article/strings.js).
--}}
{{#contentFor "preload"}}
  <link rel="preload" href="{{asset "css/page.css"}}" as="style" />
  <link rel="modulepreload" href="{{asset "js/page.js"}}" />
{{/contentFor}}
{{#contentFor "styles"}}
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{asset "css/page.css"}}" media="screen" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{asset "css/print.css"}}" media="print" />
{{/contentFor}}
{{#contentFor "scripts"}}
  <script type="module" src="{{asset "js/page.js"}}"></script>
{{/contentFor}}

{{> header}}

<main id="main" class="site-main page-main">
  {{#post}}
    <article class="document" data-document data-copy-link="{{t "Copy the link to the section"}}" data-link-copied="{{t "Link copied"}}">
      <header class="document__header">
        {{#match @page.show_title_and_feature_image}}
          <h1 class="document__title">{{title}}</h1>
          {{#if custom_excerpt}}<p class="document__lead">{{custom_excerpt}}</p>{{/if}}
        {{else}}
          <h1 class="sr-only">{{title}}</h1>
        {{/match}}
        <div class="document__meta">
          <p class="document__updated">{{t "Last updated on"}} <time datetime="{{date updated_at format="YYYY-MM-DD"}}">{{date updated_at format="LL"}}</time></p>
          <button type="button" class="document__print" data-document-print hidden>{{> "icons/printer"}}<span>{{t "Print"}}</span></button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <details class="document-toc" data-document-toc hidden>
        <summary class="document-toc__toggle">{{> "icons/summary"}}<span>{{t "Summary"}}</span>{{> "icons/chevron-down" class="document-toc__chevron"}}</summary>
        <nav class="document-toc__nav" aria-label="{{t "Table of contents"}}">
          <p class="document-toc__title" aria-hidden="true">{{t "Summary"}}</p>
          <div class="toc" data-toc-list></div>
        </nav>
      </details>

      <div class="page-content gh-content document__content js-post-content" data-document-content>
        {{content}}
      </div>
      <p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-article-live></p>
    </article>
  {{/post}}
</main>
